# Responsive HTML / CSS templates

## Stack (this repo)

- Semantic HTML5 + `viewport-fit=cover`
- Tokens from `assets/css/global.css`; page CSS only for layout/feature chrome
- Prefer modern CSS: `clamp()`, `min()`, `color-mix()`, `aspect-ratio`, `dvh`, `env(safe-area-inset-*)`
- Mobile-first media queries at **640 / 768 / 1024** (match `:root` `--bp-*`)
- Tailwind CDN is allowed on marketing/onboarding only for utilities — **do not** hardcode brand greens there; use tokens/classes

## Page skeleton

```html
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/global.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/{page}.css">
```

- One primary composition per first viewport (not a dashboard of widgets)
- Touch targets ≥ **44px** on small screens (global already bumps `.btn` on mobile)
- Images: `max-width:100%`, meaningful `alt`, prefer `aspect-ratio` wrappers

## Layout patterns

- Width: `.md-container` / `.md-container-narrow` + `--page-gutter`
- Stacks: CSS Grid/Flex with `gap` — avoid margin soup
- Sticky chrome: use `100dvh` + safe-area; bottom nav must clear `--safe-bottom`
- Accordions for multi-category lists (collapse by default for vendors)

## Theming & richness

- Surfaces: soft radial/linear washes with `--store-theme-soft`, not flat gray slabs
- Primary actions: `.btn-primary` / `.btn-primary-md` (gradient + shadow already tokenized)
- Focus: visible ring via `--store-theme-soft` — never `outline: none` without a replacement
- Motion: short transitions (≤200ms); honor `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Anti-patterns

```css
/* ❌ hardcoded brand */
.card { background: #10b981; color: #333; width: 480px; }

/* ✅ tokens + fluid */
.card {
  background: var(--store-theme-soft, var(--md-green-soft));
  color: var(--md-ink);
  width: min(100%, 30rem);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
}
```

- No fixed desktop-only widths without a fluid fallback
- No emoji-as-UI without `aria-hidden` / text alternative
- Don’t duplicate tokens in page CSS — extend global when reused ≥2 pages
